Press your advantage when your foes are starting to crumble.

For every detrimental effect on the target you deals [184, 248, 298, 340, 377 (TL1-5; SP 100)] frostdusk damage (with diminishing returns) and reduce its global speed by 25% for one turn per effect (up to a maximum of [1, 3, 5, 7, 9 (TL1-5)]).

The diminishing returns on damage bonus works this way:

*  2 effects: [268, 360, 432, 493, 547 (TL1-5; SP 100)]
*  5 effects: [378, 509, 610, 696, 772 (TL1-5; SP 100)]
*  10 effects: [461, 621, 744, 849, 942 (TL1-5; SP 100)]
*  15 effects: [510, 686, 823, 939, 1042 (TL1-5; SP 100)]

And so on…

Damage increases with your Spellpower.
